    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game brings the classic bowling experience into the digital realm, with clear and smooth graphics that perfectly recreate the atmosphere of a bowling alley. Players can launch the ball using the W key, aiming to knock down the neatly arranged bowling pins in front. After each successful hit, the game automatically scores based on your performance, encouraging players to aim for higher scores. If you wish to restart a round, simply press the R key to quickly reset; the Q key allows players to return to the main menu at any time, offering convenience and ease. The sound design is also spot-on, from the rolling of the ball to the crisp sound of pins falling, immersing players in the joy of each throw as if they were in a real bowling alley.</p>",
